# Project core

- Flutter + Provider + go_router + ScreenUtil; Android native = Kotlin.
- Package `com.hicar.ora.limited`. Title: **Giọng Thương Gia**.
- Flutter = UI / API / config / state. Playback keep-alive / boot / BT / AA = **native**.
- Do not put business logic in widgets; use providers + services + repositories.
- Colors: cyan `#00E5FF`, black `#000000` — premium automotive dark.
- ScreenUtil: sizes via `.w` / `.h` / `.sp` / `.r` — no hardcoded px.
- Index: `AGENTS.md`. File map: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.

## Hard constraints

- Overlay entry `overlayMain` stays in `lib/main.dart` (same library as `main`).
- One owner per auto-play event (Flutter **or** native) — never both.
- Prefer device-agnostic fixes; head units vary (cheap HAL, aggressive radio apps).
- Diagnostic events → `HiCarDiagnosticLog`, not only `Log.d`.
